 Say ''
 Say 'Your universe (the database) and the server were not touched.'
-Say 'Docker reuses the freed space for future builds. Its disk image file on Windows may not shrink straight away.'
+Say 'The compile cache (up to 3 GB) is kept so rebuilds stay fast. Docker reuses the freed space; its disk image file on Windows may not shrink straight away.'
 exit 0
 '@
     Wipe = @'
@@ -424,7 +431,7 @@ $fresh = -not (Test-Image 'evemu_server')
 if ($fresh) { Say 'The server has not been built on this computer yet, so it is built first. This takes 10 to 20 minutes...' }
 Say 'Creating a fresh universe. The first start installs the database and stocks the market, which takes several minutes...'
